1276	/// The Foto tab — spec-3-3's new pick -> processingOcr ->
1277	/// recognized/error pipeline UI, mirroring `_AudioTab`'s own structure
1278	/// (a `BlocBuilder`-driven switch over its cubit's state). [controller]
1279	/// is `_InsertionModalBodyState`'s own persistent `TextEditingController`
1280	/// for the recognized text (see its own doc) — never created locally
1281	/// here, so a rebuild never loses cursor position.
